e-digit days/months (`1/1/2024`), invalid values, or extra whitespace.",\n            why="Edge cases often appear in user-entered data or integrations.",\n            rec="Add tests for normalization/padding if required, or document that input is always DD/MM/YYYY."\n        ),\n        dict(\n            title="Snapshot/structural asserts for `getTitle` may be over-specified",\n            severity="INFO",\n            category="Test maintainability",\n            location="src/__tests__/helpers.spec.js: getTitle test compares whole object",\n            issue="Asserting full object equality including `key: undefined` is brittle.",\n            why="If object shape evolves (extra fields), equality still passes, but if `key` omitted it fails though behavior is fine.",\n            rec="Prefer `toMatchObject({ projectId: \'1\', name: \'Work\' })` or assert only `.name`."\n        ),\n    ]\n)\npath=write_report("helpers.spec.js", reports["helpers.spec.js"])\npath\n', container_id='cntr_69b2a7fe810c81909a05b70d20c929c505b8e4e37121fe72', outputs=None, status='completed', type='code_interpreter_call'), output_index=19, sequence_number=7532, type='response.output_item.done')

